##

00:00:00.034 --> 00:00:02.078 size:88% position:56% line:85%
This is Tom the Taxi Driver,

00:00:02.078 --> 00:00:03.571 size:88% position:56% line:91%
London cabbie with a
YouTube channel,

00:00:03.571 --> 00:00:05.310 size:88% position:56% line:91%
which means you have
the Knowledge.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:09.459 line:91%
<c.yellow>The Knowledge of London,
the formal testing, examination</c>

00:00:09.459 --> 00:00:12.215 line:91%
<c.yellow>that every single London
taxi driver must do</c>

00:00:12.215 --> 00:00:14.367 line:91%
<c.yellow>to be able to drive the
iconic black cab.</c>

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:15.480 line:85%
So how long did it take you?

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.327 line:91%
<c.yellow>It took me just under
three years,</c>

00:00:17.327 --> 00:00:19.890 line:91%
<c.yellow>and its average is probably about
between two and four years.</c>

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.740 line:91%
And it's every road within
six miles of London, is it, or...?

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.434 line:91%
<c.yellow>The six mile radius of
King Charles I Island,</c>

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:27.917 line:91%
<c.yellow>which is roughly the
geographic centre of London.</c>

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:31.200 line:91%
<c.yellow>And it could be any road,
point of interest.</c>

00:00:31.901 --> 00:00:34.440 line:91%
<c.yellow>Examiners can ask you
anything within that area.</c>

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.034 line:91%
<c.yellow>So it's just a good idea to try
and learn as much as possible.</c>

00:00:37.034 --> 00:00:38.534 line:85%
So you've got that in your head.

00:00:38.534 --> 00:00:40.000 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yes.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>And I'm gonna have a phone.</c>

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:43.410 line:91%
And the producers have
laid out two routes for us.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.630 line:91%
<i>They're gonna tell us
each point to go to in turn,</i>

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:49.050 line:91%
<i>and our individual routes
have been set.</i>

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:53.460 line:91%
So by GPS, they should take
exactly the same amount of time.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.135 line:91%
You, on the other hand,
don't have to follow the GPS.

00:00:57.135 --> 00:00:58.312 line:91%
You get to use
all the shortcuts

00:00:58.312 --> 00:00:59.535 line:91%
and all the knowledge
that's in your head.

00:00:59.535 --> 00:01:01.134 line:91%
<c.yellow>And I'm hoping there
should be some shortcuts</c>

00:01:01.134 --> 00:01:02.775 line:91%
<c.yellow>and hopefully some
knowledge in here as well.</c>

00:01:02.925 --> 00:01:04.155 line:91%
We're gonna start
just around the corner.

00:01:04.155 --> 00:01:06.936 line:91%
I've got something that
looks like a cab but isn't.

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:08.655 line:85%
You have an actual London cab.

00:01:08.655 --> 00:01:11.025 line:91%
<c.yellow>My own taxi that I take
passengers in normally.</c>

00:01:11.025 --> 00:01:12.225 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yep.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright.</c>

00:01:12.225 --> 00:01:13.745 line:91%
Good luck.
<c.yellow>Be lucky, Tom.</c>

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:17.353 line:85%
See you at the finish.

00:01:21.134 --> 00:01:22.000 line:85%
Okay.

00:01:27.289 --> 00:01:28.050 line:85%
<c.cyan>Hello.</c>

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:29.034 line:85%
<c.yellow>How are we doing?</c>

00:01:29.034 --> 00:01:30.491 line:85%
<c.cyan>I'm good. How are you?</c>

00:01:30.729 --> 00:01:31.560 line:85%
<c.yellow>Let's do this.</c>

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:32.590 line:85%
Right, where to?

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.321 line:85%
<c.green>Where to? Well...</c>

00:01:35.735 --> 00:01:38.445 line:91%
<c.cyan>A blue plaque of
Ada Lovelace, where she lived.</c>

00:01:38.465 --> 00:01:41.104 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh, on St James's Square.</c>

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.369 line:85%
<c.cyan>Correct.</c>

00:01:43.781 --> 00:01:45.335 line:85%
<c.cyan>Gosh, you're good.</c>

00:01:46.269 --> 00:01:48.526 line:91%
<c.green>So we are going to
Mary Shelley's</c>

00:01:48.526 --> 00:01:50.044 line:85%
<c.green>blue plaque, please.</c>

00:01:50.344 --> 00:01:53.374 line:91%
Mary Shelley's blue—
that involves research!

00:01:55.414 --> 00:01:56.074 line:85%
Oh, it's fine.

00:01:56.494 --> 00:01:57.764 line:91%
Google has it.
<c.green>That's what I thought.</c>

00:01:57.764 --> 00:01:59.084 line:85%
Mary Shelley Blue Plaque.

00:01:59.084 --> 00:02:01.000 line:91%
<c.green>Yes, please.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Okay.</c>

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:05.278 line:8%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>Head northwest on Rotary Street
towards Borough Road/A3202</i></c>

00:02:02.167 --> 00:02:04.664 line:91%
Right. Handbrake off,
into drive.

00:02:05.278 --> 00:02:07.088 line:85%
Away we go.

00:02:05.278 --> 00:02:07.088 line:7%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>And turn left onto Borough Road.</i></c>

00:02:12.435 --> 00:02:15.170 line:91%
<c.cyan>So we haven't,
obviously haven't got the...</c>

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:17.934 line:91%
<c.cyan>luxury of traffic updates
here, have we?</c>

00:02:17.934 --> 00:02:19.065 line:85%
<c.cyan>We've just got you.</c>

00:02:19.065 --> 00:02:21.045 line:91%
<c.yellow>No, I've got no phone or
anything up in front of me.</c>

00:02:21.045 --> 00:02:23.246 line:91%
<c.yellow>So, on a normal working
day to day,</c>

00:02:23.246 --> 00:02:24.735 line:85%
<c.yellow>I will have a phone up.</c>

00:02:24.735 --> 00:02:27.004 line:91%
<c.yellow>Not necessarily to put
stuff in navigation,</c>

00:02:27.004 --> 00:02:30.269 line:91%
<c.yellow>but just to understand what the
streets and the roads are doing.</c>

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.190 line:85%
So important things to say.

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:35.550 line:91%
First of all, I am required
to follow all traffic laws.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:38.430 line:91%
I am required to
follow the speed limit.

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:41.301 line:91%
I'm required to drive as I
normally would in London,

00:02:41.301 --> 00:02:42.600 line:91%
which is kind of
what I'm used to.

00:02:42.867 --> 00:02:46.769 line:91%
I'm also required to
follow the GPS,

00:02:46.769 --> 00:02:49.010 line:91%
even if I know it would
currently be quicker

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:50.610 line:85%
to go down that road and right.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:53.159 line:85%
I've gotta follow the GPS.

00:02:53.534 --> 00:02:55.935 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, at least you
get to do U-turns, right?</c>

00:02:56.144 --> 00:02:58.544 line:91%
<c.yellow>Some streets, there'll be
a no U-turn sign.</c>

00:02:58.544 --> 00:02:59.195 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:02:59.474 --> 00:03:00.703 line:85%
<c.yellow>Don't wanna do one there,</c>

00:03:00.703 --> 00:03:03.110 line:91%
<c.yellow>because you'll get a fine
in the post, but yeah.</c>

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:04.664 line:91%
<c.yellow>We have quite a tight
turning circle,</c>

00:03:04.664 --> 00:03:07.309 line:91%
<c.yellow>meaning that we don't
prohibit traffic too much</c>

00:03:07.309 --> 00:03:08.694 line:85%
<c.yellow>when we turn.</c>

00:03:09.134 --> 00:03:11.926 line:91%
<c.cyan>Is it gonna be really hard
for you not going in bus lanes?</c>

00:03:12.074 --> 00:03:13.712 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah, I've almost nearly...</c>

00:03:13.712 --> 00:03:15.000 line:91%
<c.yellow>I mean, there's one
coming up here,</c>

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.899 line:91%
<c.yellow>so thank you for
reminding me, Kirsten.</c>

00:03:16.929 --> 00:03:19.173 line:91%
I'm not allowed to use
bus lanes today,

00:03:19.173 --> 00:03:22.149 line:91%
because I am not a licensed
taxi driver, so legally I can't.

00:03:22.529 --> 00:03:25.913 line:91%
So I will get undertaken
in just a moment...

00:03:26.129 --> 00:03:30.408 line:91%
by an actual London cab who is
probably gonna be wondering

00:03:28.372 --> 00:03:31.634 line:7%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>Turn left onto Lambeth Road/A3203.</i></c>

00:03:30.408 --> 00:03:31.634 line:85%
why I'm not there with him.

00:03:31.634 --> 00:03:35.369 position:61% line:91%
<c.green>That taxi driver that just passed you
did just give you a very peculiar look.</c>

00:03:35.399 --> 00:03:36.603 line:85%
I mean, there's...

00:03:36.603 --> 00:03:38.549 line:91%
To be fair, there's four cameras
attached to the vehicle.

00:03:38.549 --> 00:03:43.449 line:91%
<c.yellow>I mean, I am somewhat glad that
Tom has to abide by the satnav.</c>

00:03:43.449 --> 00:03:44.179 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:03:44.179 --> 00:03:46.088 line:85%
<c.yellow>Because I feel like he has</c>

00:03:46.088 --> 00:03:48.629 line:91%
<c.yellow>a very, very good knowledge
of London as it is.</c>

00:03:48.826 --> 00:03:49.619 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:03:49.619 --> 00:03:51.149 line:85%
<c.yellow>Through sheer osmosis.</c>

00:03:51.569 --> 00:03:54.869 position:61% line:91%
<c.cyan>I guess the good thing about Tom
being in a taxi looking vehicle though,</c>

00:03:54.869 --> 00:03:57.779 position:56% line:91%
<c.cyan>is that he will probably get treated
slightly differently on the roads.</c>

00:03:57.779 --> 00:03:58.894 line:85%
<c.yellow>Definitely.</c>

00:03:58.894 --> 00:04:00.739 line:91%
<c.yellow>If we put him in a
really small car,</c>

00:04:00.739 --> 00:04:03.060 line:91%
<c.yellow>and he is trying to pull out
of certain junctions...</c>

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.759 line:85%
<c.yellow>It's quite difficult, I'd imagine.</c>

00:04:04.759 --> 00:04:08.456 line:8%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>At the roundabout, take
the second exit onto A3203.</i></c>

00:04:09.629 --> 00:04:11.939 line:91%
I mean, obviously I'm doing
the speed limit because it's legal.

00:04:11.939 --> 00:04:12.708 line:85%
<c.green>But of course.</c>

00:04:12.708 --> 00:04:14.793 line:91%
But also because
I know that if I don't,

00:04:14.793 --> 00:04:17.679 line:91%
someone is going to be
analysing the shot behind,

00:04:17.679 --> 00:04:19.370 line:91%
and checking the speed
that I'm going.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.485 line:85%
Whoa, braking.

00:04:22.569 --> 00:04:24.530 line:91%
<c.yellow>I sort of wish I knew
where Tom was.</c>

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:27.850 line:91%
<c.yellow>Or how he's getting on,
or if he's stressing or panicking.</c>

00:04:28.419 --> 00:04:30.293 line:91%
I'm starting to get
properly frustrated

00:04:30.293 --> 00:04:32.049 line:91%
with everyone else in
London now.

00:04:32.809 --> 00:04:35.238 line:91%
<c.green>It's interesting.
Do you feel more frustrated</c>

00:04:35.238 --> 00:04:37.520 line:91%
<c.green>because you're in the
energy of a black cab?</c>

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:39.739 line:85%
<c.yellow>Here we go, we're not far now.</c>

00:04:39.739 --> 00:04:41.599 line:91%
<c.yellow>We're just gonna do a right
here into Marlborough Road.</c>

00:04:41.604 --> 00:04:42.140 line:85%
<c.cyan>Okay.</c>

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:45.319 line:91%
<c.yellow>And then, St James's Square,
almost after that.</c>

00:04:45.453 --> 00:04:46.150 line:85%
<c.cyan>Okay.</c>

00:04:46.309 --> 00:04:49.383 line:91%
I keep expecting to see
Tom in the other cab,

00:04:49.383 --> 00:04:51.770 line:91%
and then I remember we're
not going the same route.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:52.949 line:85%
We're not racing.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:54.679 line:85%
<c.green>No, you're not racing.</c>

00:04:54.679 --> 00:04:57.409 line:91%
We're not gonna see each
other until the finish line.

00:04:57.414 --> 00:04:58.489 line:85%
Whoever gets there first.

00:04:58.489 --> 00:04:59.599 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh, I see a blue plaque.</c>

00:04:59.599 --> 00:05:01.259 line:91%
<c.yellow>There we go.</c>
<c.cyan>Chatham House.</c>

00:05:02.469 --> 00:05:04.349 line:91%
<c.yellow>Not that one.
That's a different one.</c>

00:05:04.349 --> 00:05:05.752 line:91%
<c.cyan>Ah.</c>
<c.yellow>Ada Love...</c>

00:05:05.752 --> 00:05:07.091 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah, Ada Lovelace.
There we go.</c>

00:05:07.091 --> 00:05:09.330 line:91%
<c.cyan>Ah-mazing!</c>
<c.yellow>Pioneer of computing lived here.</c>

00:05:09.479 --> 00:05:12.180 line:91%
Stop off number one is gonna
be on your right very shortly.

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:13.710 line:85%
<c.green>Lovely, oh.</c>

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:16.530 line:91%
<c.green>So we're looking for
a blue plaque.</c>

00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.599 line:85%
And I'm gonna pull in here.

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:22.080 line:7%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>Your destination is on the right.</i></c>

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:24.090 line:91%
We are close enough
that the GPS is okay with it.

00:05:24.094 --> 00:05:25.650 line:91%
Hazards are on.
<c.green>Right.</c>

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:26.820 line:91%
And handbrake on.
Off you go.

00:05:27.479 --> 00:05:28.848 line:91%
<c.green>Let's go find.</c>
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(door closes)</i></c>

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:33.960 size:53% position:27% line:85%
<c.green>Mary Shelley.</c>

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:36.120 size:84% position:42% line:91%
<c.green>Author of Frankenstein,
lived here for a bit.</c>

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:38.520 size:72% position:36% line:91%
<c.green>Right, let's go get
back in the cab.</c>

00:05:38.895 --> 00:05:39.630 size:66% position:67% line:85%
<c.cyan>Have we got it?</c>

00:05:40.109 --> 00:05:41.867 line:91%
If you wonder what the
beeping is, that's the

00:05:41.867 --> 00:05:43.560 line:91%
'passenger has left
the door open' alarm.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.000 line:85%
'Ello, right.

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:46.667 line:85%
<c.green><i>(posh accent)</i> Hello.</c>

00:05:46.667 --> 00:05:48.570 line:91%
Do close the door
after you, please.

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:49.560 line:91%
These were the
beeping in here.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:50.670 line:85%
Right, next one please.

00:05:51.793 --> 00:05:52.830 align:end size:94% position:94% line:91%
Where are we off to?
<c.green>Ah, hello.</c>

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.860 align:end position:100% line:91%
<c.green>I'm a very fancy lady, and I would
like to go to Liberty please.</c>

00:05:58.447 --> 00:05:59.450 line:85%
<c.yellow>Hello, madam.</c>

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:00.990 align:end size:97% position:97% line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(posh accent)</i> Hello, old chap.</c>

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:02.820 align:end position:100% line:85%
<c.cyan>I'd like to go to Harrods, please.</c>

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:04.890 align:end size:94% position:94% line:91%
