<c.cyan>Okay, good.</c>

00:06:09.659 --> 00:06:11.130 line:85%
<c.yellow>This is bread and butter stuff now.</c>

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:12.450 line:91%
<c.cyan>Good, yeah.</c>
