<c.yellow>Straight on the Piccadilly Underpass.</c>

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.710 line:85%
<c.yellow>A4, fair left Brompton Road.</c>

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.140 line:91%
<c.yellow>Bosh.</c>
<c.cyan>Yeah, is that our route?</c>

