00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:14.391 line:8%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>In 200 yards, your destination
will be on the left.</i></c>

00:15:15.108 --> 00:15:17.420 line:91%
Approaching on the left
very shortly.

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.990 line:85%
Isaac Newton's place.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.640 line:85%
Let's see where I'm parking.

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:25.070 line:91%
I'm gonna park just here
on the right.

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:30.000 line:91%
Isaac Newton's place is
just ahead on the left,

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.650 line:85%
and...

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:32.540 line:85%
you're off.

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:34.770 line:91%
<c.yellow>I'm not looking forward to
this one, if I'm completely honest.</c>

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:35.681 line:91%
<c.cyan>Really?</c>
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:38.033 line:91%
<c.yellow>So geographically we
might have worked it all out,</c>

00:15:38.033 --> 00:15:39.506 line:91%
<c.yellow>but it's the time wise
of getting through it.</c>

00:15:39.506 --> 00:15:40.100 line:85%
<c.cyan>Right.</c>

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:44.567 line:91%
<c.green>Please tell me I can
take the wig off now.</c>

00:15:44.709 --> 00:15:45.462 line:85%
<c.colorFFCC88>Yeah.</c>

00:15:47.069 --> 00:15:50.515 line:91%
<c.cyan>So this is our final stop
before the last stop.</c>

00:15:50.515 --> 00:15:51.195 line:85%
<c.yellow>Wow, okay.</c>

00:15:51.195 --> 00:15:53.175 line:91%
<c.cyan>This is our penultimate
stop, I should say.</c>

00:15:53.175 --> 00:15:55.155 line:91%
<c.yellow>I think I'm getting
more anxious as it goes on.</c>

00:15:55.425 --> 00:15:57.225 line:91%
Another costume,
another character. Let me guess.

00:15:57.225 --> 00:15:59.010 line:85%
<c.green>I'm going on my hen do up north.</c>

00:15:59.010 --> 00:15:59.775 line:85%
Alright.

00:15:59.775 --> 00:16:01.807 size:88% position:56% line:91%
<c.green>So I need you take
to Kings Cross, please love.</c>

00:16:01.807 --> 00:16:03.225 size:88% position:56% line:85%
Kings Cross Station.

00:16:03.225 --> 00:16:04.005 size:88% position:56% line:85%
<c.green>Yes, please.</c>

00:16:04.305 --> 00:16:05.745 line:85%
<c.yellow>So now we're on Oxford Street.</c>

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:07.060 line:91%
<c.cyan>Okay.</c>
<c.yellow>This is the moment of truth.</c>

00:16:07.060 --> 00:16:08.830 line:91%
<c.yellow>We turn left and we,
shock horror...</c>

00:16:09.743 --> 00:16:10.630 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh, it's looking good.</c>

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:12.370 line:91%
<c.cyan>And not too bad.</c>
<c.yellow>It's looking good.</c>

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:13.706 line:91%
<c.yellow>So those buses
are stopped by that light,</c>

00:16:13.706 --> 00:16:15.220 line:91%
<c.yellow>and there's no one at
Tottenham Court Road.</c>

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:16.391 line:91%
<c.cyan>Okay, great.</c>
<c.yellow>That is very good.</c>

00:16:16.391 --> 00:16:17.455 line:85%
<c.yellow>I'm pleased so far.</c>

00:16:18.152 --> 00:16:20.515 line:0%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>London Ultra Low
Emission Zone on route.</i></c>

00:16:20.515 --> 00:16:21.520 line:85%
You don't need to tell me that.

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:23.616 line:91%
I'm already in the
London Low Emission Zone.

00:16:24.488 --> 00:16:25.820 line:85%
Alright, cool.

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:28.900 line:91%
We are— Oh my god,
24 minutes for this run.

00:16:29.349 --> 00:16:29.830 line:85%
<c.green>Whew!</c>

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:30.970 line:85%
This is gonna be a slow one.

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:32.851 line:85%
I got a big red warning on my GPS.

00:16:33.585 --> 00:16:35.535 line:91%
<c.yellow>I just hope that Tom
is having a very fun time.</c>

00:16:35.535 --> 00:16:36.753 line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(laugh blurt)</i></c>

00:16:37.155 --> 00:16:38.955 line:91%
<c.cyan>I hope he's hit
shed loads of traffic.</c>

00:16:40.149 --> 00:16:41.015 line:85%
<i>(guttural groan)</i>

00:16:42.405 --> 00:16:43.875 line:91%
There has to be a
faster way through this.

00:16:44.055 --> 00:16:44.715 line:85%
There has to be.

00:16:45.285 --> 00:16:46.845 line:91%
<c.yellow>Sadly though,
there is no other way.</c>

00:16:47.151 --> 00:16:49.885 line:91%
<c.yellow>If it was my limitations
