00:16:49.885 --> 00:16:51.675 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>
<c.yellow>I would be very upset.</c>

00:16:52.095 --> 00:16:54.465 line:91%
For this second time 'round,
it's taken us up here.

00:16:55.215 --> 00:16:58.065 line:85%
And... it does look clear.

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:01.440 line:91%
<c.yellow>It is tight, but frankly the
