00:17:02.507 --> 00:17:03.683 line:85%
<c.yellow>No one behind.</c>

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:06.960 line:85%
<c.yellow>Plenty in front.</c>

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.167 line:91%
<c.cyan>It would be great
