00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:12.219 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, yeah, yeah.
You're fine now.</c>

00:17:13.195 --> 00:17:14.819 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh, smashed it!</c>

00:17:14.819 --> 00:17:18.839 line:91%
To be fair to the GPS, I haven't
