00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:26.261 position:58% line:0%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>Turn right onto Great Russell Street.</i></c>

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.250 line:91%
<c.yellow>Once we straighten up,
