<c.green>That's them!</c>

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:37.767 line:85%
Where?

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:39.290 line:85%
<c.green>Right behind us.</c>

00:17:38.783 --> 00:17:41.620 line:0%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>In 200 yards, turn left
