00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.110 line:85%
You're kidding.

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:41.620 line:85%
<c.green>Nope.</c>

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.540 line:85%
<c.cyan>And they just passed us, I think.</c>

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:48.150 line:91%
<c.yellow>I feel so lost.
Oh no, don't.</c>

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:50.040 line:91%
<c.cyan>Oh no.</c>
<c.yellow>Are they going north?</c>

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:50.925 line:85%
<c.cyan>They are going north.</c>

00:17:50.925 --> 00:17:52.665 line:91%
<c.yellow>Oh, we've lost it then,
we've lost it.</c>

00:17:52.665 --> 00:17:53.626 line:85%
<c.yellow>There's nothing I can do.</c>

00:17:53.626 --> 00:17:54.515 line:85%
<c.cyan>Not necessarily.</c>

00:17:56.955 --> 00:17:58.335 line:85%
So you've got the tracker.

00:17:58.711 --> 00:18:00.625 line:91%
Are they following us?
Are we going the same way?

00:18:00.805 --> 00:18:02.264 line:91%
<c.green>We are not. No.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright.</c>

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:04.185 line:85%
So that was just a coincidence.

00:18:04.185 --> 00:18:06.855 line:91%
<c.green>It was a complete chance
that we just crossed paths.</c>

00:18:06.855 --> 00:18:08.075 line:85%
<c.yellow>Okay...</c>

00:18:08.415 --> 00:18:09.065 line:85%
<c.yellow>Options, options.</c>

00:18:09.065 --> 00:18:10.215 line:85%
<c.cyan>Okay, we're not far now, right?</c>

00:18:10.905 --> 00:18:16.304 line:91%
<c.yellow>Not far as the crow flies, but
there will be invariably traffic.</c>

00:18:17.114 --> 00:18:18.735 line:85%
This is absolutely not a race.

00:18:19.725 --> 00:18:21.165 line:91%
I may or may not
be ahead of them.

00:18:21.165 --> 00:18:22.125 line:85%
It doesn't matter.

00:18:22.125 --> 00:18:24.304 position:58% line:85%
I'm just driving as I normally would.

00:18:26.935 --> 00:18:27.905 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh god.</c>

00:18:30.615 --> 00:18:31.819 line:85%
<c.cyan>This is painful.</c>

00:18:32.025 --> 00:18:33.405 line:85%
<c.yellow>It could be worse, Kirsten.</c>

00:18:33.405 --> 00:18:34.635 line:85%
<c.yellow>The metre could be running.</c>

00:18:34.864 --> 00:18:36.645 line:85%
<c.cyan>Ha! This is so true.</c>

00:18:37.665 --> 00:18:39.412 line:91%
About this time, you'd
probably be right to complain

00:18:39.412 --> 00:18:41.295 line:91%
