ticking up, you know.

00:18:41.295 --> 00:18:41.955 line:85%
<c.green>That's true.</c>

00:18:42.515 --> 00:18:43.595 line:85%
<c.green>Although the metre stopped.</c>

00:18:45.295 --> 00:18:46.515 line:91%
I don't actually
know how to work it.

00:18:48.075 --> 00:18:48.915 line:85%
<c.green>Number was too big.</c>

00:18:48.915 --> 00:18:50.505 line:91%
No one gave me instructions
