00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:53.060 line:85%
<c.yellow>Here we go.</c>

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.020 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yes.</c>

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:55.511 line:85%
<c.yellow>Freedom!</c>

00:18:56.430 --> 00:18:58.560 line:91%
I'm getting competitive now.
That's not my—

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:01.500 line:91%
My job is to drive like your
average mini cab driver.

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:02.000 line:85%
<c.green>Yeah.</c>

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:04.530 line:91%
Follow the GPS.
Do what it tells me.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:08.070 line:91%
I am an interface between
Google Maps and the passengers.

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:10.847 line:91%
And my job is not to get
overcompetitive

00:19:10.847 --> 00:19:13.020 line:91%
about the fact it
sent me a terrible way.

00:19:13.629 --> 00:19:15.040 line:85%
<c.yellow>Holborn Station's coming up.</c>

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:17.290 line:91%
<c.yellow>I'm sure you know, madam,
that this is your appropriate train</c>

00:19:17.290 --> 00:19:18.420 line:85%
<c.yellow>to get you back to Essex.</c>

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:20.580 line:85%
Right, we're nearly there.

00:19:21.605 --> 00:19:22.330 line:85%
<c.green>Ohh.</c>

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:25.200 line:91%
There is an official pick-up
and drop-off point here.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:27.110 line:91%
<c.cyan>Out I get.</c>
<c.yellow>Should be open now, yeah.</c>

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:28.050 line:85%
<c.cyan>Holborn Station.</c>

00:19:29.747 --> 00:19:30.390 line:85%
<c.cyan>Thank you.</c>

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.710 line:85%
I'll be here somewhere.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:33.780 line:91%
This appears to be a
valid set-down point.

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:35.430 line:85%
I might be further along.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.055 line:91%
<c.green>Oh, lovely.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Go.</c>

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:39.178 line:85%
<c.green>Thank you very much.</c>

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:41.649 line:85%
<c.green>Have a good day!</c>

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.950 align:start size:94% position:6% line:85%
<c.cyan>It's really busy now.</c>

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:45.420 align:start size:94% position:6% line:85%
<c.cyan>This is so embarrassing!</c>

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:46.370 align:start size:94% position:6% line:85%
<c.cyan>Okay, great.</c>

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.009 align:start size:94% position:6% line:85%
<c.cyan>Let's go, next stop.</c>

00:19:48.495 --> 00:19:48.995 line:85%
<c.green>Good?</c>

00:19:49.485 --> 00:19:50.385 line:85%
<c.green>Good, right.</c>

00:19:50.745 --> 00:19:51.614 line:85%
<c.green>One last stop.</c>

00:19:54.935 --> 00:19:55.435 line:85%
<c.cyan>Okay.</c>

00:19:56.895 --> 00:19:59.385 size:88% position:56% line:85%
<c.cyan>Final stop, Gibson Square.</c>

00:19:59.574 --> 00:20:00.794 size:88% position:56% line:85%
<c.yellow>Gibson Square?</c>

00:20:00.794 --> 00:20:01.864 size:84% position:58% line:85%
<c.cyan>Do you like my moustache?</c>

00:20:02.084 --> 00:20:06.665 line:91%
<c.yellow>You seem to have grown
caterpillar upon your top lip.</c>

00:20:06.665 --> 00:20:08.175 line:85%
<c.cyan>The things you do for your job.</c>

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:10.120 line:85%
Alright.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:12.160 line:91%
Do we have another character
or are you just you now?

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.060 line:85%
<c.green>Oh no.</c>

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:16.953 line:85%
Oh— <i>(laughs uproariously)</i>

00:20:17.260 --> 00:20:18.220 line:85%
Where are we headed to?

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:20.590 line:91%
<c.green>We are going to
Gibson Square, please sir.</c>

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:23.541 line:91%
<c.green>My name's Mr. Taxi,
and Gibson Square has</c>

00:20:23.541 --> 00:20:26.135 line:91%
<c.green>some kind of importance to
when you learned the Knowledge.</c>

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:27.105 line:85%
Right.

00:20:27.105 --> 00:20:28.455 line:85%
<c.green>Can't remember what it is.</c>

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:31.680 line:91%
Gibson Square it is.
It's in the GPS.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:32.820 line:85%
Let's go.

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:34.921 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah, so Gibson Square,</c>

00:20:34.921 --> 00:20:37.350 line:91%
<c.cyan>that is particularly
memorable for you, right?</c>

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:39.644 line:91%
<c.yellow>Every London cabbie,
possibly anyone</c>

00:20:39.644 --> 00:20:41.880 line:91%
who's ever tried attempting
the Knowledge.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:42.660 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:46.650 line:91%
<c.yellow>The very first run goes
from Manor House Station...</c>

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:47.654 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:20:47.654 --> 00:20:49.590 line:91%
<c.yellow>off of Green Lanes,
if we were at Manor House.</c>

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:50.760 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>
<c.yellow>to Gibson Square.</c>

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.280 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah, hopefully I know
where Gibson Square is.</c>

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.722 line:91%
<c.cyan>So everyone has to
learn Gibson Square.</c>

00:20:55.999 --> 00:20:57.350 line:91%
<c.cyan>Doing the Knowledge.</c>
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>

00:20:57.390 --> 00:20:59.370 line:91%
So here's the thing,
I couldn't U-turn there.

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:00.270 line:85%
<c.green>Right.</c>

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.130 line:85%
There's no easy way to do that.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:04.800 line:91%
And the GPS had
a bit of a problem,

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:07.192 line:85%
and it's now stuck on re-routing.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:07.980 line:85%
<c.green>Oh.</c>

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:10.980 line:91%
<c.yellow>I just hope that Tom
has had a good day out.</c>

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:14.310 line:91%
I was meant to say
thank you to the cab behind.

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:16.230 line:91%
I forgot there was this
little plastic thing there.

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:17.210 line:85%
<c.green>Did you just slam it?</c>

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.330 line:85%
Whacked my hand on that.

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:20.850 line:85%
<c.yellow>I want Tom to do well.</c>

00:21:21.791 --> 00:21:23.070 line:85%
<c.cyan>Aw, that's nice.</c>

00:21:23.531 --> 00:21:26.738 line:91%
<c.yellow>I want to see people seeing
him drive across London</c>

00:21:26.738 --> 00:21:28.605 line:91%
<c.yellow>and go, that's Tom Scott
driving a black cab.</c>

00:21:29.745 --> 00:21:30.675 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh yeah, that all happened.</c>

00:21:30.675 --> 00:21:32.475 line:91%
<c.yellow>And then you know
the seas parted for him.</c>

00:21:32.475 --> 00:21:33.593 line:85%
<c.yellow>You know, come on Tom.</c>

00:21:33.764 --> 00:21:38.222 line:85%
My GPS is just stuck on re-routing.

00:21:38.222 --> 00:21:40.000 line:85%
It doesn't even know where I am.

00:21:40.064 --> 00:21:42.915 line:91%
And I am right in the middle
of Kings Cross with full 5G.

00:21:43.784 --> 00:21:46.695 line:91%
So I'm just gonna have to
find somewhere safe to stop.

00:21:47.085 --> 00:21:48.165 line:85%
Here we go, that's a lay-by.

00:21:48.165 --> 00:21:49.245 line:85%
Alright, we're gonna stop here.

00:21:51.375 --> 00:21:53.242 line:91%
I'm gonna have to join
the start of that route,

00:21:53.242 --> 00:21:54.675 line:85%
and then just try and follow it.

00:21:54.675 --> 00:21:55.784 line:85%
There's no other way to do it.

00:21:57.225 --> 00:21:58.635 line:91%
<c.yellow>I'm kind of a pessimist
