00:21:58.635 --> 00:22:01.104 line:91%
<c.yellow>We're gonna turn up, he's gonna
be in Gibson Square, smiling.</c>

00:22:01.104 --> 00:22:01.665 line:85%
<c.cyan>So true.</c>

00:22:01.665 --> 00:22:03.725 line:91%
<c.yellow>Looking at me saying,
"Where did you get to?"</c>

00:22:03.725 --> 00:22:04.784 line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:22:04.784 --> 00:22:06.385 line:91%
<c.yellow>And that'll be forever emblazoned—</c>
<c.cyan>"What took you so long?"</c>

00:22:06.405 --> 00:22:07.594 line:91%
<c.cyan>He's gonna say something
like that, isn't he?</c>

00:22:07.794 --> 00:22:10.784 line:91%
<c.yellow>That's gonna be emblazoned in my
brain for the rest of my eternity.</c>

00:22:11.774 --> 00:22:14.235 line:91%
<c.yellow>And I will no longer be able to
complete my job as a cab driver.</c>

00:22:14.985 --> 00:22:16.155 line:85%
<c.yellow>I might as well hand him my badge.</c>

00:22:16.425 --> 00:22:21.030 line:91%
But I forgot just how mentally
tiring it is to constantly do this.

00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:23.190 line:91%
I dunno how Tom does it
for hours and hours.

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:28.950 line:91%
<c.yellow>♪ Drive, drive, drive your car
gently down the road ♪</c>

00:22:30.150 --> 00:22:34.650 line:91%
<c.yellow>♪ Merrily, merrily, merrily...
obey the highway code ♪</c>

00:22:36.390 --> 00:22:37.920 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh my god, it's so close.</c>

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:38.520 line:85%
<c.yellow>Oh.</c>

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:39.720 line:85%
<c.cyan>It's actually so close.</c>

00:22:39.720 --> 00:22:40.560 line:85%
